## SEO Rules for Multi-Market Content

1. **India-first**: 80%+ of Vedic astrology traffic comes from India. Always optimize for India first.
2. **Bilingual wins**: Hindi/Hinglish content outperforms English-only by 2-3x CTR in India (KundliAI data). Use Devanagari in titles where possible.
3. **Career > Marriage**: Career astrology is 39% of India queries vs 24% for marriage (Ishvaram 351K conversations). Prioritize career content.
4. **Don't assume one system globally**: Vedic for India/Nepal/Sri Lanka/Bangladesh, Western zodiac for Africa/LatAm, Chinese for East/Southeast Asia.
5. **South Africa opportunity**: 47% engagement but few Vedic astrology competitors. English content works. Target Western + Vedic hybrid content.
6. **hreflang**: Currently en/hi/ne/pt/es/ja/x-default (7 locales). When adding new locales, ensure reciprocal hreflang pairs.
7. **Festival spikes**: Indian festivals (Navratri, Diwali, Chhath) drive traffic spikes 1-2 weeks before. Plan seasonal content.
8. **Wedding season**: Indian wedding muhurats (Nov-Feb, Apr-Jun) drive "vivah muhurat" queries. Time content accordingly.

